<div class="header">
  <h1 class="header-title">Investigating the Impact of Magnetic Fieldson the Superconductivity of High-Temperature Ceramics</h1>
  <p class="header-authors">Dr. Alice Green, Dr. Patrick Green, Leslie Thomas, Diego Ruiz</p>
  <div class="header-image">
